t", "x": 2562.5, "y": 9740.875, "width": 1216.8750000000002, "height": 46.875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 1116115064, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 553406199, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Still open: the face's Open list, the settled ones left out", "originalText": "Still open: the face's Open list, the settled ones left out", "fontSize": 38, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-62537f2d4e08", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 9809.625, "width": 1073.875, "height": 68.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 1267560874, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 625794386, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. What must each level's report answer? The Studio sets it, each level\nreports (s01, s09 Later 1).", "originalText": "1. What must each level's report answer? The Studio sets it, each level\nreports (s01, s09 Later 1).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-0c4d7d17b723", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 9898.625, "width": 1164.625, "height": 68.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 2064614442, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2056821111, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2. List Job and Task reports in the Block's Report, by source (s09-D08), once\na Job has one?", "originalText": "2. List Job and Task reports in the Block's Report, by source (s09-D08), once\na Job has one?", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-bb291745ed01", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 9987.625, "width": 1134.3750000000002, "height": 68.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 928021928, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1259372357, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6. When a cited studio frame changes, flag the report for review before its\nanswer changes?", "originalText": "6. When a cited studio frame changes, flag the report for review before its\nanswer changes?", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-e239a4a9ad9e", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 10076.625, "width": 1179.75, "height": 171.875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 315193732, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1019878965, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "9. Share the names (s05-D08, the recommendation; the watcher session agreed\n261011) or, as the alternative, keep one list for Studio and Report? A real\ncase, 261012: the Studio's Levels group went with its three topics, while Q01\nand Q02 keep `group: Levels`; shared names keep their Report group (④ lists it\nafter the Studio's names), one list would leave them Untagged.", "originalText": "9. Share the names (s05-D08, the recommendation; the watcher session agreed\n261011) or, as the alternative, keep one list for Studio and Report? A real\ncase, 261012: the Studio's Levels group went with its three topics, while Q01\nand Q02 keep `group: Levels`; shared names keep their Report group (④ lists it\nafter the Studio's names), one list would leave them Untagged.", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-deb7bebf4aff", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 10272.875, "width": 756.25, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 166124786, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 862401113, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "10. Q11, how a Page's logic is drawn: Guide or UI?", "originalText": "10. Q11, how a Page's logic is drawn: Guide or UI?", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-6a86765b7a33", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 10326.125, "width": 1149.5, "height": 68.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 414007434, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1918861158, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "11. The starting groups of discovery, design and labeling are guesses: learn\nthem on one real Block each (s01's s09 Later 1 says the same).", "originalText": "11. The starting groups of discovery, design and labeling are guesses: learn\nthem on one real Block each (s01's s09 Later 1 says the same).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-2994e48c5ca5", "type": "text", "x": 2562.5, "y": 10415.125, "width": 1134.3750000000002, "height": 137.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 326731683, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1663425754, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "13. Each theme Block (b11 to b17) owns its theme's list? For the paper, yes\n(b16 s05-D02, proposed 261011): b10 keeps the rule and this table, b16 the\npaper's four groups and its standing Questions. The other six theme Blocks\nhave not answered.", "originalText": "13. Each theme Block (b11 to b17) owns its theme's list? For the paper, yes\n(b16 s05-D02, proposed 261011): b10 keeps the rule and this table, b16 the\npaper's four groups and its standing Questions. The other six theme Blocks\nhave not answered.", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-fe796a6d2fde", "type": "text", "x": 3812.5, "y": 9809.625, "width": 1164.625, "height": 240.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 2085279113, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 487255989, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "14. Answered for the paper by b16 s05-D01 (proposed 261011): a Question's\n`group:` is its kind (Ideation, Narrative, or an asker: reviewer, coauthor,\neditor, reader). The telling is said once, in its **Feeds:** line (q00_ to\nq06_), so Research questions are the Questions it feeds, read by id; a\nresearch question needs no group line, and `nmi-cgm-scaling-axes` keeps\nworking unedited. b16 s05 Open 5 asks which name the screen keeps, RQ0 or Q00\n(JL's choice).", "originalText": "14. Answered for the paper by b16 s05-D01 (proposed 261011): a Question's\n`group:` is its kind (Ideation, Narrative, or an asker: reviewer, coauthor,\neditor, reader). The telling is said once, in its **Feeds:** line (q00_ to\nq06_), so Research questions are the Questions it feeds, read by id; a\nresearch question needs no group line, and `nmi-cgm-scaling-axes` keeps\nworking unedited. b16 s05 Open 5 asks which name the screen keeps, RQ0 or Q00\n(JL's choice).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-7fd1fa2902cd", "type": "text", "x": 3812.5, "y": 10077.375, "width": 1164.625, "height": 103.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 2041887858, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 185762332, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "15. An insight topic (Sleep; Variants, Timing): a `group:` line in each\nquestion.md's front matter in the Prototype, so every Board of that Prototype\nshares it? And agree the 12 SMS topic names (s05-D14).", "originalText": "15. An insight topic (Sleep; Variants, Timing): a `group:` line in each\nquestion.md's front matter in the Prototype, so every Board of that Prototype\nshares it? And agree the 12 SMS topic names (s05-D14).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-c17fbb4485ab", "type": "text", "x": 3812.5, "y": 10202.125, "width": 1149.5, "height": 103.125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6ef948af6bd0", "roundness": null, "seed": 2010253860, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2123234112, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "16. A paper's research questions have two names, RQ0 to RQ6 in the Story and\nQ00 to Q06 in the register: which one does the screen keep (b16 s05 Open 5,\nJL's choice)?", "originalText": "16. A paper's research questions have two names, RQ0 to RQ6 in the Story and\nQ00 to Q06 in the register: which one does the screen keep (b16 s05 Open 5,\nJL's choice)?", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-111ea1d022f8", "type": "frame", "x": 5525.0, "y": 8671.875, "width": 3590.0, "height": 1994.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 763577003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1406636967, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "In Tools: haipipe-report"}, {"id": "kept_s-dc69469dea38", "type": "text", "x": 5600.0, "y": 8746.875, "width": 1650.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "st